  "text": "The gate of a car park writes one line per event in <code>log.txt</code>: <code>plate time event</code>, with the time as <code>HH:MM</code> and the event <code>IN</code> or <code>OUT</code>. The lines are in time order and a car can come back more than once in the day. Parking costs 1.50 EUR per started hour (at least one hour). Write a Python program that:",
